<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.6">
  <book code="1TH" style="id">Baebu Thyaa</book>
  <para style="h">1 THESALON</para>
  <para style="toc1">1 Thessalonians</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 THESALON</para>
  <para style="toc3">1Th</para>
  <para style="mt">THESALON HAE</para>
  <para style="mt2">KALAN PAUL CCAKY KYKHEITNAW</para>
  <para style="mt2">1 Thessalonians</para>
  <para style="imt">Byalaanmaw</para>
  <para style="im">Thesalonika khua hynh Rom nynh a ukpaw Mesidonia pee kya-e khuapi nynh thua. Filipi khua kha a cciataw koute hynh-e khua kya Paul nynh Khriccaawbuu a rae. Thuasalama aro mawze Judah beiknaw kalan thinlung a pya hae paw Judah ccungccaw athua lei hae paw laku kya Paul nynh Khriccaaw phung a hopaw tuh taenaw a mue keiccuze Juda hae kyate dounaw te eiungnaw a hoi hae. Paul tuh pahepatote Thesalonika khua kyate Berea lang a cciasah hae. Korin khua a thua koute Paul nynh Thesalonika khua e khriccaawbuu konglang kha ryalahkheihtu Timote kyate a thae.</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Thesalon hae kalan Paul Ccaky Kykheitnaw</char> hynh tuin kya-e Khriccaaw hae thawpyanaw te lungthang leite atyn kho nawlan hae zeipaw nynh thua. Mih zynnaw te sungsahnaw konglang a thae vae ze a luung hae. Mih kya a um lyaze a hiinzia bua a liathuisah hae, te Khri rungnaw konglang Khriccaawbuu kyate a poupaw kha a phipya hae: Khri rung maw kya a chih hae paw zyntu hae hynh oun rung vae hae ze zungzae hiinnaw lungkhu kya a umbua cih hae tou? Hohtuhmou Khri yn rung cih? Khri rungnaw ngaehoite na ngaw lya oh hynh daebabi lan nae rya hynh lawkuh oh, cite Paul nynh a cipya hae.</para>
  <para style="iot">Alungkhu Umpaw</para>
  <para style="io1">Byalaanmaw — 1.1</para>
  <para style="io1">Lungtuanaw te thehoysahnaw — 1.2—3.13</para>
  <para style="io1">Khriccaaw hiinzia hanlan tuhounaw — 4.1-12</para>
  <para style="io1">Khri rungnaw kong ccangpyanaw — 4.13—5.11</para>
  <para style="io1">Nyathyakou tuhounaw — 5.12-22</para>
  <para style="io1">Athangnaw — 5.23-28</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Beihlangnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Paul, Silas te Timote nynh Paaw Pachia te Bawipaw Jesu Khri kya a umpaw Thesalon khua e khriccaawbuu kalan ccaw kae ky oh. Thawccinaw te daenaw tuh nae kya la um sah.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 17:1">Loc 17.1</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s1">Thesalon hae Zynnaw te Hiinnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nanning balyn hanlan Pachia kalan lungtuabya palei kae ho zah kae sawsangnaw kya nanning kha palei kae hobia oh. <verse number="3" style="v" />Ah Paaw Pachia malang nae zynnaw te asekuhpaw nae ryalawnaw, sungsakunaw hoite na zuakunaw oh te ah Bawipaw Jesu Khri kya atynpaw nae ngaehoinaw kha tyty kae liathui. <verse number="4" style="v" />Pachia nynh a sungsahpaw uteno hae, amaw nynh nanning kha ae po vae oh cipaw kae ny. <verse number="5" style="v" />Pawccecize kaening kya-e thehoypaw tuh bya kyalya te thua leite, thungnaw te Thyaa Muisaw te ny ccaccingnaw te nynh yn thua; nae kya kae um lyaze kaening tuh nanning hanlan pawcihawpaw ccungccaw hae nynh kae thua cipaw kha na ny oh. <verse number="6" style="v" />Nanning tuh vawsawnaw patae na teing oh zemah Thyaa Muisaw kyate yn thuapaw lungtuanaw khate Pachia bya kha na lawkuh oh zah, kaening thydokuh hae paw te Bawipaw thydokuh hae paw nynh na thua oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 17:5-9">Loc 17.5-9</ref></char></note> <verse number="7" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Mesidonia ram te Akhai ram kya umpaw zyntu hae balyn hanlan nanning tuh dosuinku lan um hae paw nynh na thua oh. <verse number="8" style="v" />Pawccecize nanning kyate Bawipaw bya roi tuh Mesidonia ram te Akhai ram kya kyalya ccae khyh, Pachia na zynnaw oh paw tuh hmin takyh kya mah pong zeihkuh vae, tukeiccuze kaening nynh paw sanmah kae ho ho vae khyh. <verse number="9" style="v" />Pawccecize kaening nynh nae kalan pawcihte nynh kae tee cipaw kaening kong kha tuin ram kya-e ccungccaw hae nynh a ho hae, te a hiinpaw te ahmepaw Pachia kha ryalawpya khylan zohtuh hae kyate Pachia kalan pawcihte nynh na paleihku oh cipaw kha thuasah, <verse number="10" style="v" />yn thua lanpaw thinrianaw kyate aening kha yn luesahtupaw Jesu, Pachia nynh chinaw kyate a thoosahpaw, vaawlang kyate yn thua cih paw a Ccapaw ngaw lanpaw kha thuasah a ho hae.</para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Thesalon kya Paul Ryalawnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Uteno hae, nae kalan kae thuapaw hynh accakaepaw thua khyh cipaw kha naemaw ccaccei nynh na ny oh. <verse number="2" style="v" />Na ny vae oh hawte, kaening tuh Filipi khua kya teingnaw te maethyanaw kae mue salamah, rawsenaw patae laku te Pachia thehoypaw kha nae kalan ho khylan rawhoynaw kha ah Pachia kyate kae mue.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 16:19-24">Loc 16.19-24</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 17:1-9">17.1-9</ref></char></note> <verse number="3" style="v" />Pawccecize kae hyynaw oh paw hynh lingkunaw, nungsikunaw te pheekunaw kyate yn pou khyh. <verse number="4" style="v" />Thehoypaw kha zyn lan um lante ho lan Pachia nynh nawccawkhaepaw kae thua thyhte, ccungccaw lungrythuasah khylan thua leite, kae thinlung oun syntawpaw Pachia lungrythuasah khylan nynh kae ho. <verse number="5" style="v" />Pawccecize na ny vae oh hawte, poonaw bya kha papin kae mang boi khyh, karankunawpaw vawnin bya mah kae mang khyh cipaw Pachia tuh kae ccaekia nynh thua. <verse number="6" style="v" />Khri kya-e locceihtu hae kae thua hawte, a ngiakuh lanpaw kae thua salamah, nanning kya thuasah, mingccang hae kya thuasah ccungccaw hae kya-e thehoysakunaw kha kae ccungkuh khyh. <verse number="7" style="v" />Nung nynh a ccaaw hae kha a do-oih hae hawte kaening tuh nae kya nebaleih lante kae um. <verse number="8" style="v" />Nanning kha myarya kae sungsah oh keiccuze Pachia thehoypaw kyalya thua leite, kae hiinnaw heize neethung lan kae ry oh, pawccecize nanning tuh kaening hanlan myarya sungsah lan na um oh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Uteno hae, thawbangte zuakute rya kae lawpaw kha na ny oh; Pachia thehoypaw kae hopya lya oh kha, nanning lu kheit hanlan sanmah phuripaw kae thua khyh nawlan, khuazi khuadae rya kae lawkuh. <verse number="10" style="v" />Nanning zyntu hae laku kya thyaararih lan, dingrarih lan, ccaenaw um lei lante nynh kae hiin cipaw nanning tuh ccaekia hae na thua oh zah Pachia mah ccaekia nynh thua. <verse number="11" style="v" />Paaw nynh a ccaaw hae a ccuepe hae hawte, nanning milu raveih kha kae ccuepe oh, <verse number="12" style="v" />amaw a peenaw te a phu-enaw kalan ae ko oh paw Pachia te angaekuh lante na hiin nawlan oh nanning kha kae hyy oh zah thawzung pyate bya kae tawsya oh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kaening kyate na thae oh paw Pachia bya na lawku lya oh kha ccungccaw bya lante lawku leite, ahme ccaccingpaw Pachia bya lante na lawku oh, tuh-e bya tuh nanning zyntu hae lungkhu kya rya a lah; tuh-e hanlan Pachia kalan apaekuh lei lan lungtuabya kae ho. <verse number="14" style="v" />Uteno hae, nanning tuh Khri Jesu kya umpaw, Judea ram e Pachia khriccaawbuu hae nynh thydoku hae paw lang na tang oh; pawccecize minmin tuh Judah hae keiccu a teing hae hawte nanning mah naemaw ccungccaw hae keiccu tuhcihawpaw tuh na teingbua oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 17:5">Loc 17.5</ref></char></note> <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuh-e Judah hae nynh Bawipaw Jesu te profeh hae kha theih hae zah kaening kha mah oun tuaa oun sah hae; minmin nynh Pachia kha a lunghoysah khyh hae, te ccungccaw miakaw kha a rawse hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:23">Loc 9.23</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 9:29">29</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 13:45">13.45</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 13:50">50</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 14:2">14.2</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 14:5">5</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 14:19">19</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 17:5">17.5</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 17:13">13</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 18:12">18.12</ref></char></note> <verse number="16" style="v" />Zenta hae nynh khumnaw a muebua khyh ccaw hae cite kaening kha thehoypaw ho lan oun khee hae; tuhcite mih seinaw kha palei a biachihku hae, nyathyakou tuh mih tungvaw kya Pachia thinrianaw accah.</para>
  <para style="s1">Paul nynh Khuaccong A Ry Ki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Uteno hae, kaening tuh nanning ryte thinlung lante thua leite, pyn lante sosoh ah phiakuh oh pawte myarya kae ngae oh zah nae mitmae muih lan myaryamaw kae ry. <verse number="18" style="v" />Tukeiccuze nae kalan thua lan kou kae ry. Kae, Paul mah atu te atu thua lan ka ry, thuasalama Satan nynh kaening kha phe oun khee. <verse number="19" style="v" />Ah Bawipaw Jesu Khri yn thua te, amaw malang kae ngaehoinaw, kae lungpawnaw te kae pookunawpaw bawilukhung tuh pawmou athua? Tuh-e tuh nanning na thua khyh oh tou? <verse number="20" style="v" />Pawccecize nanning tuh kae phu-enaw te lungpawnaw nynh na thua oh.</para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tukeiccuze kaening nynh he kae ngaesang kho khyh tuh, Athen khua kya kae makhaete umhy lan bya kae paeku.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 17:15">Loc 17.15</ref></char></note> <verse number="2" style="v" />Khri thehoypaw kya rya kae lahkheihpaw, Pachia rya a lahpaw, kae neitaw Timote kha nae zynnaw kya thawzung tynsah khylan te thawpya khylan nae kalan kae saw, <verse number="3" style="v" />hynh-e tuaasahkunaw hae keiccuze hum sanmah nulang na ki khyh nawlan oh kae saw. Thanccingte, kaening tuh hynh-e tuaasahkunaw teing khylan popaw nynh kae thua cipaw naemaw ccaccei nynh na ny oh. <verse number="4" style="v" />Pawccecize nae kya kae um lyaze, tuaasahkunaw kae teing vae cih cite kae hopya ty vae oh; kae hopya oh hawte acyikupaw kha na ny oh. <verse number="5" style="v" />Hynh-e keiccuze, he ka ngaesang kho khyh tuh, nae zynnaw kha ny khylan Timote kha kae saw; tuhoutu nynh nanning kha ccangkhakheit te ae tuhou cih oh zah kae ryalaw tuh alakaw lan a tangsei cih cipaw kae thinphang.</para>
  <para style="s1">Timote nynh Thawzung Pyanaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Thuasalama atu nae kyate kaening kalan Timote he yn thua tuh nae zynnaw te sungsakunaw thongpang hoypaw kha oun phupya; kaening kha ahoy lante tyty nae liathui oh zah, kaening nynh muih lan kae ry oh hawte nanning nynh mah muih lan nae ry oh cipaw kha mah oun hopya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:5">Loc 18.5</ref></char></note> <verse number="7" style="v" />Tukeiccuze uteno hae, riathaenaw te tuaasahkunaw kae teing lyakhe nae zynnaw nynh nanning konglang lungtangnaw oun pya. <verse number="8" style="v" />Pawccecize Bawipaw kya tynkaring lan na thadyn oh zetuh, atu kaening tuh kae hiin. <verse number="9" style="v" />Ah Pachia malang nanning keiccuze kae lungtuanaw balyn hanlan Pachia kalan nanning elang pawtemou lungtuabya phe zaw lan kae ho kho cih? <verse number="10" style="v" />Nae mae kae muih nawlan te nae zynnaw kya ahoboupaw kae ccingsahpya nawlan oh, khuazi khuadae thawte saw kae sangpah oh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ah Paaw Pachia amaw te ah Bawipaw Jesu nynh kae laanpi tuh nae kalan oun paccynpah vae sah. <verse number="12" style="v" />Nae tungvaw sungsakunaw kae hoi hawte, nanning mah lu kheit te lu kheit na sungsakunaw oh te ccungccaw balyn na sungsahnaw oh kha Bawipaw nynh lesah thung sah lah ccingsah vae sah. <verse number="13" style="v" />Ah Bawipaw Jesu tuh a mithyaa hae balyn ryte yn thua vae ze, ah Paaw Pachia malang nae thinlung kha thyaanaw kya ccaenaw um lei lante ae tynsah vae oh sah.</para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Pachia Lungrypaw Hiinnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nyathyakou, uteno hae, nanning nynh pawtemou hiin lan accan, Pachia kha pawtemou a lungrythuasah lan accan cipaw kha kae kyate na ccangku vae oh hawte, tuhcite houhouh na hiin nawlan oh, Bawipaw Jesu min te kae ngia oh zah kae hyy oh. <verse number="2" style="v" />Pawccecize Bawipaw Jesu liate pawcihawpaw kawbya hae mou kae pya oh cipaw kha na ny oh. <verse number="3" style="v" />Pawccecize Pachia nynh a rypaw tuh na thyaa lan oh paw kha nynh thua: nanning nynh ohhuakunaw kha na sungku nawlan oh, <verse number="4" style="v" />nanning milu raveih nynh nae pyn kha athyaapaw te sawtuapaw athua nawlan pawtemou sungku lan cipaw na ny nawlan oh, <verse number="5" style="v" />Pachia nyh leipaw Zenta hae hawte myarya ohhuaku rynaw thinlung kha hoi leite, <verse number="6" style="v" />hynh-e kong kya hum nynh sanmah a uno kha hynpyate a sei khyh nawlan Pachia nynh a ry. Pawccecize kaening nynh kae hopah vae oh zah raeringnaw hoyte kae pya vae oh hawte, Bawipaw tuh tuhcihawpaw uccaw balyn hanlan liarutu nynh thua. <verse number="7" style="v" />Pawccecize Pachia nynh aening kha athyaa leipaw kalan ko leite athyaapaw kalan nynh oun ko. <verse number="8" style="v" />Tukeiccuze hynh-e ccangpyanaw a eipaw tuh ccungccaw ccangpyanaw kha a eipaw thua leite, a Thyaa Muisaw ae pyatu oh paw Pachia ccangpyanaw kha a eipaw nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Thuasalama uteno sungsakunaw konglang te lukhakheit nynh nae kalan zei ho vae khyh, pawccecize Pachia nynh naemaw ccaccei kha lu kheit te lu kheit sungsaku lan ae ccangpya vae oh. <verse number="10" style="v" />Mesidonia ram kya umpaw uteno hae balyn kha tuhcite na sungsah ccaccing vae oh. Thuasalama uteno hae, tuhlaeze houh ahoy lante na hiin nawlan oh kae ngia oh. <verse number="11" style="v" />Kae hopya vae oh hawte, daebabi lan na umthya nawlan oh, nae ryalaw kha pekikute, nae kuih te na lawku nawlan oh kae ngia oh; <verse number="12" style="v" />atolang e ccungccaw hae kya kou ngaekuh lante na hiin nawlan oh te ming hae kha na ngaehoiku khyh nawlan oh kae ngia oh.</para>
  <para style="s1">Bawipaw Rungnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Uteno hae, ngaehoinaw a hoi leipaw mingccang hae nynh mih ngaethya hawte nae ngaethya khyh nawlan a chih hae paw konglang kha ny leite na um lan oh paw ka ry khyh. <verse number="14" style="v" />Pawccecize Jesu tuh chih zah a thoothui cite ah zyn oh ze, tuhawte Jesu kya a chih hae paw kha amaw ryte Pachia nynh a cciakhae cih hae. <verse number="15" style="v" />Kaening nynh Bawipaw bya liate e hynh kae hopya oh: Bawipaw yn thua cia ah hiinhy oh paw aening nynh a chih vae hae paw kha laan ah thoih lan khyh oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.15-17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 15:51-52">1Ko 15.51-52</ref></char></note> <verse number="16" style="v" />Pawccecize Bawipaw amaw tuh kawpyanaw roi, vaaw hae lakuze lupi athuapaw roi te Pachia mungkae roi ryte vaawlang te yn rungbung cih. Tetuh Khri kya a chih hae paw tuh masaty oun tho cih hae. <verse number="17" style="v" />Tukoute ah hiinhy oh paw aening tuh vaawlang kya Bawipaw te tungku khylan minmin ryte pynkheihlan maeking kya hangthung ah thua cih oh, tetuh Bawipaw ryte zungzae umkheih lan vae. <verse number="18" style="v" />Tukeiccuze hynh-e bya hae hynhte lu kheit te lu kheit thawzung la pyakuh oh.</para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Thuasalama uteno hae, accyh te kumvaelori kong tuh nae kalan zei ho vae khyh. <verse number="2" style="v" />Pawccecize Bawipaw Nin tuh khuazi e miruh hawte nynh yn thua cih cipaw kha naemaw nynh ccaerarih lan na ny oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:43">Mat 24.43</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:39">Luk 12.39</ref>; <ref loc="2PE 3:10">2Pe 3.10</ref></char></note> <verse number="3" style="v" />“Daenaw te khynnaw a um,” a ci lya hae khe, ccaaw a poipaw nopinung tungvaw neitangia nynh a thuanua hawte, minmin tungvaw ronaw nynh vaekheihmawte oun thuanua cih hae zah minmin tuh lue lan khyh hae. <verse number="4" style="v" />Thuasalama uteno hae, nanning tuh mohnaw kya na um khyh oh keiccuze tuh-e Nin nynh miruh hawte yn thuapaw kha na siikuh lan khyh oh. <verse number="5" style="v" />Nanning balyn tuh awnaw ccaaw hae te khuadae ccaaw hae nynh na thua oh; aening tuh khuazi ccaaw hae te mohnaw ccaaw hae ah thua khyh oh. <verse number="6" style="v" />Tukeiccuze ming hae nynh a i hae hawte ih nan oh sih, aening tuh raeringkuh oh sih lah, hawrarih lan um oh sih. <verse number="7" style="v" />Pawccecize a ih hae paw tuh khuazi nynh a i hae, a rui hae paw mah khuazi nynh a rui hae. <verse number="8" style="v" />Thuasalama aening tuh khuadae te ah seku oh keiccuze hawrarih lan um oh sih, zynnaw te sungsakunaw kya-e bykhaw khate ccaankuh oh sih lah, khumnaw kya-e ngaehoinaw sivawlukhung kha khungkuh oh sih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 59:17">Isa 59.17</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 6:13-17">Efe 6.13-17</ref></char></note> <verse number="9" style="v" />Pawccecize Pachia nynh a thinrianaw kha teing khylan aening kha oun paccyn khyh; ah Bawipaw Jesu Khri liate khumnaw mue khylan nynh oun paccyn. <verse number="10" style="v" />Aening tuh ah thaeku oh zemah, ah i oh zemah, amaw ryte umkheih khylan, Khri tuh aening hanlan a chih. <verse number="11" style="v" />Tukeiccuze na cyimae oh hawte thawzung pyakuh kalang oh lah, lu kheit te lu kheit tynsakuh oh.</para>
  <para style="s1">Nyathya Hyynaw te Beihlangnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Uteno hae, nae kya ryalahtu hae, Bawipaw kya ae cciakhae oh paw te ae thuihei oh paw kha saw la tua oh cite kae ngia oh; <verse number="13" style="v" />mih ryalaw keiccuze minmin kha myarya sawtua oh lah sungsah oh. Naemaw te naemaw ccawkute la um oh. <verse number="14" style="v" />Uteno hae, nanning kha kae ngia oh; mih thawnaw hae paw kha raeringnaw la pya oh, lungthawzya hae paw kha thawzung la pya oh, thawzya hae paw kha la bawm oh, ccungccaw miakaw kya nae lung la sae sah. <verse number="15" style="v" />Hum nynh sanmah lukhakheit tungvaw hoyleinaw kha hoyleinaw te a liaru khyh nawlan raeringkuh sah, naemaw te naemaw kya thuasah, ccungccaw balyn kya thuasah ahoypaw kha rae lan zuakuh zungzae oh. <verse number="16" style="v" />Zungzae nae lungtua sah. <verse number="17" style="v" />Apaekuh lei lan sawsang oh. <verse number="18" style="v" />Atyn-are kya lungtuabya ho oh; pawccecize tuh-e tuh Khri Jesu kya nae hanlan Pachia rynaw nynh thua. <verse number="19" style="v" />Thyaa Muisaw kha daesah nan oh. <verse number="20" style="v" />Profehbya honaw kha pawlangria leite um nan oh. <verse number="21" style="v" />Pawpaw balyn kha syntawtua oh lah, ahoypaw kha tynkaring lan kyngkuh oh; <verse number="22" style="v" />ahoy leipaw miakaw kha sibia oh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Daenaw Pachia amaw ccaccei nynh nanning kha marya ae la thyaasah vae oh sah; ah Bawipaw Jesu Khri yn thua te, nae muisaw, nae thinlung te nae pyn kha abalynte ccaenaw um lei lan ae la nung vae oh sah. <verse number="24" style="v" />Nanning ae kotu oh paw tuh a lungzipaw thua zah, tuhcite a cyih cih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Uteno hae, kaening hanlan saw oun la sangpah oh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Uteno hae balyn kha athyaapaw myngkunaw khate bya la beih oh. <verse number="27" style="v" />E ccaky hynh uteno hae balyn kha la riapah oh cite Bawipaw liate kae nynh bya kae tawsya oh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ah Bawipaw Jesu Khri thawccinaw tuh nae kya la um vae sah.</para>
</usx>